5572: \subsection{Primary--supplement interface}
5573: 
5574: \paragraph{Submission-interface checklist.}
5575: For this presentation-only route, the primary reviewed artifact is
5576: \path{submission_abstract.tex} and the long record is \path{main.tex}.  The short
5577: artifact must expose the following five interface components so that reviewers
5578: can check it against the supplement without reading an abstraction proof:
5579: \begin{enumerate}
5580: \item an abbreviated publication-safety rule: agent output is advisory unless a
5581: typed evidence surface and deterministic gate permit the corresponding claim;
5582: \item an explicit pointer to
5583: the finite-record interface theorem, Theorem~\ref{thm:publication-safety-interface}, and to the pinned discovery-gate
5584: source interface at commit \path{3fb3d6a0641767388a401883062aa522ea0b397b};
5585: \item the four case-row names from Table~\ref{tab:case-witnesses}: Newmath
5586: intake isolation, upper-fibers overlap block, fake-extension block, and Rule110
5587: limitation gate;
5588: \item the evidence-level boundary that path-verified rows support reviewability
5589: and path completeness, not command-run validation, fresh full-source rebuilds,
5590: daemon execution, or Rule110 dynamic reruns; and
5591: \item the supplemental-upload pointer to \path{review_bundle/}, which carries
5592: the source snapshot, source-interface record, case-evidence manifest, and longer
5593: technical account.
5594: \end{enumerate}
5595: The current short source satisfies this checklist in its structured-source,
5596: publication-safety, and review-artifact paragraphs.  The checklist is the
5597: submission contract; it replaces any need to treat this supplement's metadata
5598: lemmas as part of the compact presentation claim.
