5788: \label{prop:round-five-venue-record-instantiation}
5789: The files
5790: \path{review_bundle/VENUE_BIBLIOGRAPHY_LIVE_CHECK_2026-06-09.log} and
5791: \path{review_bundle/VENUE_BIBLIOGRAPHY_LIVE_CHECK_2026-06-09.md}
5792: instantiate the dated local-readiness branch required by
5793: Corollary~\ref{cor:upload-time-venue-compliance-record-requirement}.  Their finite
5794: fields are the command \path{PowerShell Invoke-WebRequest against CICM route pages
5795: and bibliography authority pages}, environment \path{Windows PowerShell 5.1 from
5796: paper directory; network enabled}, source state \path{current working tree for
5797: main.tex, submission_abstract.tex, references.bib, theorem_inventory.json,
5798: theorem_inventory.md, review_bundle/REVIEW_BUNDLE_MANIFEST.json, and
5799: review_bundle/FINAL_DIGESTS_SHA256.md at the recorded 2026-06-09 local-readiness packaging}, exit code \path{0}, log path
5800: \path{review_bundle/VENUE_BIBLIOGRAPHY_LIVE_CHECK_2026-06-09.log}, and record path
5801: \path{review_bundle/VENUE_BIBLIOGRAPHY_LIVE_CHECK_2026-06-09.md}.  This is
5802: not an upload-time venue-compliance record, EasyChair upload receipt, archive
5803: locator, venue acceptance record, or proceedings-status certificate.
5804: \end{proposition}
5805: 
5806: \begin{proof}
5807: The named log and record contain the five command-run fields required in
5808: Definition~\ref{def:operational-acceptance-interface}: command, source state,
5809: environment, exit code, and log path.  The URL rows record status \path{200} for
5810: the CICM call page, EasyChair interface, LNCS guidance page, DOI or arXiv
5811: locators, and public source repository, and its token rows record the required
5812: presentation-only, two-page, bibliography, EasyChair, Springer/LNCS, and source
5813: markers.  The final boundary line of the log states that the run is only a live
5814: route and bibliography freshness check and excludes venue acceptance, upload
5815: receipt, public archive locator, Lean rebuild, and artifact reruns.  Therefore it
5816: is exactly a dated local-readiness record in the sense of
5817: Corollary~\ref{cor:upload-time-venue-compliance-record-requirement}, and it does
5818: not supply the stronger external records explicitly excluded in the statement.
5819: \end{proof}
